# Calibration output: regenerated by `bench run`, machine/run-specific.
results/

# Task fixtures are snapshot-derived: a pure `git archive` of the pinned commit in each
# task.yaml `snapshot:` block (usually the shared `monolith-backend` preset), so the bytes
# are redundant with the real repo. Never commit them; materialize before a run with
# `bench snapshot`. Any task still carrying a hand-written fixture is mid-migration to a
# real-repo snapshot; it stays tracked until then (git keeps tracking already-tracked
# files regardless of this ignore).
tasks/*/fixture/
